From: PortareOS <hello@portare.org>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qdsp6: allow 44100 on the playback DAIs

Three sites, not two. The first version of this patch changed the
Q6AFE_CDC_DMA_RX_DAI and Q6AFE_MI2S_RX_DAI macros and assumed both
playback ports were built from them. Only the headphone port is.

PRIMARY_MI2S_RX, which is the speakers, is written out longhand inside
q6dsp_audio_fe_dais[] with its own narrower list:

	.stream_name = "Primary MI2S Playback",
	.rates = SNDRV_PCM_RATE_48000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_8000 |
		 SNDRV_PCM_RATE_16000,

48000, 8000 and 16000, and nothing else. So the speakers refused 44100
no matter what the macro said, which is what the hardware reported:

  # aplay -D hw:0,0 -f S16_LE -r 44100 -c 2 -d 2 /dev/urandom
  Warning: rate is not accurate (requested = 44100Hz, got = 48000Hz)

Refined rather than rejected, which is a rate mask doing its job.

44100 is added to that entry and kept in both macros, so the headphone
path via RX_CODEC_DMA_RX_0 keeps what it already gained. Capture is left
alone.

This half only makes the rate reachable. The machine driver pins every
backend to 48000 separately; see the next patch.
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6dsp-lpass-ports.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6dsp-lpass-ports.c
@@ -47,8 +47,8 @@
 		.playback = {						\
 			.stream_name = #did" Playback",	\
 			.rates = SNDRV_PCM_RATE_8000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_16000 |\
-				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_32000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_48000 |\
-				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_176400,			\
+				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_32000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_44100 |\
+				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_48000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_176400,	\
 			.formats = SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S16_LE |		\
 				   SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S24_LE |		\
 				   SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S32_LE,		\
@@ -100,8 +100,8 @@
 		.playback = {						\
 			.stream_name = pre" MI2S Playback",	\
 			.rates = SNDRV_PCM_RATE_8000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_16000 |\
-				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_32000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_48000 |\
-				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_176400,			\
+				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_32000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_44100 |\
+				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_48000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_176400,	\
 			.formats = SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S16_LE |		\
 				   SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S24_LE |		\
 				   SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S32_LE,		\
@@ -386,8 +386,8 @@
 	}, {
 		.playback = {
 			.stream_name = "Primary MI2S Playback",
-			.rates = SNDRV_PCM_RATE_48000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_8000 |
-				 SNDRV_PCM_RATE_16000,
+			.rates = SNDRV_PCM_RATE_48000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_44100 |
+				 SNDRV_PCM_RATE_8000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_16000,
 			.formats = SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S16_LE |
 				   SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S24_LE,
 			.channels_min = 1,
